Third-party content in this repository is NOT covered by the MIT license above
and remains under its own terms; it is included for reproducibility only:

- fonts/Figtree-*.ttf: Copyright 2022 The Figtree Project Authors, licensed
  under the SIL Open Font License 1.1 (see fonts/OFL.txt).
- data/kth_courses/: programme syllabi, course names and examination modules
  retrieved from public pages on www.kth.se (KTH Royal Institute of Technology).
- data/schedule_review/: copies of the published schedule reviews at
  https://cohm.github.io/kth-schedule-review/ (derived from KTH TimeEdit
  schedules) and study-plan files from github.com/cohm/ProgramVisualization.
- Admission statistics in data/cohorts.yaml: Swedish Council for Higher
  Education (UHR), https://www.uhr.se/studier-och-antagning/antagningsstatistik/
- Numbers cited from the SCI Makerspace planning documents in data/facility.yaml
  are facts quoted with their source; the documents themselves are not included.
